    "text": "<p>Given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd><mtd><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd><mtd><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p>Now differentiating the function w.r.t&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>We get,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>10</mn></mfenced><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>5</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>40</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>30</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></math>&nbsp;or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p>Required&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>125</mn></math></p>"
